  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "In the office pantry, Bu Xiaogu spots Xiaoye cheering at her phone screen over the fan crowdfunding campaign for singer Xin Huimei. Listen to their Mandarin chat first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "这是在给辛惠美众筹那个违约金吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "居然筹到了这么多钱啊！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xiaoye",
      "t": "粉丝会长发帖号召，哪有钱少的道理？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "谁在组织这次募捐啊？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xiaoye",
      "t": "连粉丝团的大人物你都不知道吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xiaoye",
      "t": "不过这个一点也不重要。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "那最重要的是什么？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xiaoye",
      "t": "最重要的是我们家惠美自由了！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "你们干吗去啊？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xiaoye",
      "t": "我们去吃饭啦，快走吧！",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "这是在给辛惠美众筹那个违约金吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Is this crowdfunding that contract penalty fee for Xin Huimei?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "居然筹到了这么多钱啊！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'They actually raised this much money!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xiaoye",
      "t": "粉丝会长发帖号召，哪有钱少的道理？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'When the fan-club leader posts a call, how could the total ever be small?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "谁在组织这次募捐啊？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Who is organising this fundraiser?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xiaoye",
      "t": "连粉丝团的大人物你都不知道吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Do you not even know the big names in the fan club?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xiaoye",
      "t": "不过这个一点也不重要。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Still, that does not matter at all.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "那最重要的是什么？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Then what is the most important thing?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xiaoye",
      "t": "最重要的是我们家惠美自由了！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What matters most is that our Huimei is free!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "你们干吗去啊？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Where are you all heading off to?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xiaoye",
      "t": "我们去吃饭啦，快走吧！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'We are going to eat lunch; let us go!'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
